    <h2 class="bold mb-4">Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>Your privacy is critically important to us.</p>
    <p>We respect your privacy and we are committed to protecting
    personally identifiable information you may provide us through
    the Website. This Privacy Policy applies to
    https://www.educatersroom.com (hereinafter referred to as
    “educater’s Room”, "us", "we", “our” or
    "https://www.educatersroom.com"). We have defined this privacy
    policy to explain what information and content may be collected
